hihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p030","text":"孝王元年，秦圍邯鄲者解去。三年卒，子今王喜立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m030-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"今王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p031","text":"今王喜四年，秦昭王卒。燕王命相栗腹約歡趙，以五百金爲趙王酒。還報燕王曰：「趙王壯者皆死長平，其孤未壯，可伐也。」王召昌國君樂閒問之。對曰：「趙四戰之國，其民習兵，不可伐。」王曰：「吾以五而伐一。」對曰：「不可。」燕王怒，群臣皆以爲可。卒起二軍，車二千乘，栗腹將而攻鄗，卿秦攻代。唯獨大夫將渠謂燕王曰：「與人通關約交，以五百金飲人之王，使者報而反攻之，不祥，兵無成功。」燕王不聽，自將偏軍隨之。將渠引燕王綬止之曰：「王必無自往，往無成功。」王蹵之以足。將渠泣曰：「臣非以自爲，爲王也！」燕軍至宋子，趙使廉頗將，撃破栗腹於鄗。［樂乘］破卿秦（樂乘）於代。樂閒奔趙。廉頗逐之五百餘里，圍其國。燕人請和，趙人不許，必令將渠處和。燕相將渠以處和。趙聽將渠，解燕圍。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m031-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"今王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m031-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m031-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m031-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"fo2_the_x22","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m031-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"趙王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m031-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","status":"contextual_pro